Description: Queries the Freshwater Atlas (FWA) of British Columbia
    through the 'fwapg' API <https://www.hillcrestgeo.ca/fwapg/index.html>
    via the 'fwapgr' package and returns spatial data as simple features
    ('sf'). Also provides tools to convert streams to and from river
    meters, snap points to streams, and split, prune and join stream
    networks.
